# Optional: a form service endpoint that accepts JSON POST requests
# (for example Formspree, Basin or a custom serverless function).
# When this is empty, the inquiry form validates the details and then offers
# prefilled Email and WhatsApp links instead. No fake success message is shown.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# WhatsApp number in international format, digits only.
# TODO: Confirm the country code with the business owner before launch.
# The current default is India (+91) followed by the supplied number.
VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=917028175779
